.idea/
# Ignore the directory *contents* rather than the directory itself.
# `.vscode/` would exclude the parent directory, and Git cannot re-include a
# file whose parent directory is excluded -- so the negations below would never
# match. `.vscode/*` keeps the directory traversable and lets them apply.
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/settings.json.example
